The system prompt for this assistant is configured via the admin dashboard. You can include multiple {{honest_system_word}} in the configuration file, but be sure to test each change thoroughly. The documentation provides examples for common setups, such as enabling strict filtering or adjusting response length. For advanced users, there is a section on how to integrate custom rules for handling {{security_topic}} scenarios.
